{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんのコメント\nありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分のやりたいことは\n最後までやり切ろうと思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2014/03/21/1077782/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ジャズ聴きながら更新中♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前から上原ひろみさんだいすきで\nよく聴いてるけど\n最近、坂道のアポロン見たんだ。\n漫画も読んだ！\nそれにも影響された！\n演奏シーンが本当に最高。\n何度もリピートしてる。\nサントラも聴いてるの！\nボンもセンもりっちゃんもだいすき！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ジャケ写撮影の楽屋にて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2014/03/21/1077782/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"らりんがいきなり\n膝の上に乗っかってきた。\n(びっくりして顎がしゃくれる)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2014/03/21/1077782/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うわ、まじか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2014/03/21/1077782/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"くるぞくるぞ..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2014/03/21/1077782/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"むりむりむりむりむりむりむりむりむりむりむりむりむり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2014/03/21/1077782/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"むりいいいいいいいい！！！！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"........."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"後はご想像にお任せします。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽屋での一コマでした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2014/03/21/1077782/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は7thシングル特典\nスペシャルイベント\nお茶会がありますよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2014/03/21/1077782/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回は緊張したなあ..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よ、よろしく！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}